{"id":"torrey:raven-the","source":"torrey","name":"Raven, The","slug":"raven-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Unclean and not to be eaten — Le 11:15; De 14:14.","refs":[["Lev",11,15,11,15],["Deut",14,14,14,14]]},{"text":"Called the raven of the valley — Pr 30:17.","refs":[["Prov",30,17,30,17]]},{"text":"Black. — Song 5:11.","refs":[["Song",5,11,5,11]]},{"text":"Solitary in disposition. — Isa 34:11.","refs":[["Isa",34,11,34,11]]},{"text":"Improvident. — Lu 12:24.","refs":[["Luke",12,24,12,24]]},{"text":"Carnivorous. — Pr 30:17.","refs":[["Prov",30,17,30,17]]},{"text":"God provides food for — Job 38:41; Ps 147:9; Lu 12:24.","refs":[["Job",38,41,38,41],["Ps",147,9,147,9],["Luke",12,24,12,24]]},{"text":"Sent by Noah from the ark — Ge 8:7.","refs":[["Gen",8,7,8,7]]},{"text":"Elijah fed by — 1Ki 17:4-6.","refs":[["1Kgs",17,4,17,6]]},{"text":"Plumage of, illustrative of the glory of Christ — Song 5:11.","refs":[["Song",5,11,5,11]]}],"refCount":13}
